/-! ## The Five Lemma and Diagram Lemmas (L5) -/

/-- Five Lemma: In a commutative diagram with exact rows,
if α is surjective, ε is injective, and β, δ are isomorphisms, then γ is an isomorphism.
This is a proof technique using diagram chasing. -/
